{
  "answer": "The player who achieved the most wins of the League of Legends European Championships is Rasmus \"Caps\" Borregaard Winther, who achieved 12 wins on April 14, 2024 (E3, E6).\n\nRegarding his positional achievements mentioned in the record details:\n*   He was the **2nd player to reach 2000 kills in the LEC** (E6).\n*   He was the **4th player to reach 300 wins** (E6).\n*   He holds the record for the **most LEC Finals MVPs at 5** (E6).",
